/E (In Austin, Texas, the EWB Domestic Subteam has partnered with the Festival Beach Community Garden to address rising water costs and inconsistent irrigation. Our team is designing a system that integrates stormwater diversion, rainwater harvesting, reclaimed water reuse, and solar-powered pumping, ensuring year-round water access while reducing reliance on potable supply. Since our partnership began in the summer of 2024, our team has co-developed an engineering Work Plan with the garden and )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
